{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55823","headline":"赠陈文亮（题拟） · 文彧","name":"赠陈文亮（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻学汤休长鬓髭，罢修禅颂不披缁。\n龙盂虎锡安何处，象简银鱼得几时。\n宗炳社抛云一榻，李膺门醉酒千巵。\n莫言谁管你闲事，今日尘中复是谁？\n（周本淳校点本《诗话总龟》卷三九引《雅言系述》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"文彧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55823.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55823","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}